The **official repository** is https://github.com/V-KMilev/vkmEngine.

A **product** is a game or other application that you make with the engine,
whose value to its users comes substantially from your own content and
functionality rather than from the engine itself.

**Engine code** is the engine's source code, and the engine or any changed
version of it in any form, other than as part of a product.

A **contribution** is a change or addition to the engine that you submit to the
licensor for inclusion in the official repository.

**You** are the individual or entity agreeing to these terms, and **your
company** is any legal entity, sole proprietorship or other kind of
organization that you work for, plus all organizations that have control over,
